  "translation": "Yesterday was Sunday. I went to the bookstore with my friend Xiao Zhang. We set off from home and took a bus to the city center. The bookstore was on the third floor of a shopping mall. On the left was the literature section, and on the right was the science section. We first entered the literature section; there were many books inside. The covers of these books looked nice. I picked up a book and looked at the price; it wasn't expensive. I asked the shop assistant, 'What is this book about?' The assistant said, 'Thirty-five yuan.' I liked it very much, so I bought this book. Xiao Zhang bought a plant book in the science section. Then we went to a café next to the bookstore. I also ordered a cup of coffee, and he ordered a cup of tea. We drank and chatted, and we were all very happy. At two in the afternoon, we rested on the square outside the bookstore for a while. After going home, I immediately started reading that book."
